Package: otherworldspalettes
Title: Art-Inspired Palettes for Scientific Graphics
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Aleksandra", "Olow", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "ola.olow@gmail.com")
Description: Provides nested high-contrast qualitative palettes, sequential
    gradients, and artistic or neutral-centered diverging palettes inspired by
    the 'Other Worlds' art project. Includes discrete and continuous colour
    and fill scales for 'ggplot2', plus examples of selecting palettes for
    scientific graphics.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/aolow/otherworldspalettes
BugReports: https://github.com/aolow/otherworldspalettes/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Suggests:
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0),
    knitr,
    testthat
VignetteBuilder: knitr
